### NOTE — Optimistic Locking (Banking me Must)
-------------------------------------------------

Problem: Do admins same rule ko simultaneously update karein — last-write-wins ho jaata hai, aur pehle admin ka change silently lost ho jaata hai.

Solution: Rule table me ek version column maintain karo. Update karte waqt client If-Match header me wahi version bheje jo usne us rule ko read karte waqt dekha tha.

Flow:

- Admin A rule read karta hai (version = 3) → update bhejta hai If-Match: "v3" → DB match karta hai → update success → version 4 ho jaata hai.
- Admin B bhi rule read karta hai (version = 3) → update bhejta hai If-Match: "v3" → DB check karta hai ki current version 4 hai, 
  request wala 3 → mismatch → 412 Precondition Failed return hota hai. Admin B ko force re-fetch karna padega (fresh version = 4), phir retry karega.



